msgstr "YAML (mahazatra)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Fikirakirana SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Tsy mahafaoka ny fitaovana rehetra ny fahazoan-dalanao momba ny fitaovana, ka tsy afaka manondrana na manafatra ny fikirakirana SmokePing ianao. Manontania mpandrindra manana fidirana amin'ny fitaovana rehetra."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Hanondrana ny Fikirakirana SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Mitahiry ny fikirakirana ny plugin, ny lasibatra SmokePing novakin'ny plugin, ary ny fitaovana ifandraisan'ny tsirairay amin'ny alalan'ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano sy ny famaritana ny fitaovana ny fanondranana. Tsy mitahiry loharanon-drakitra, kisary, rakitra RRD, na fanamarinam-panalahidy izy io."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Sintony"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Hanafatra Fikirakirana SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Ny fisafidianana rakitra dia manamarina azy fotsiny. Ny efijery manaraka dia mitanisa ny fanovana rehetra hataon'ny rakitra, ary tsy misy soratana raha tsy manamafy io lisitra io ianao. Ny fanafarana dia manampy sy manavao; tsy mamafa lasibatra na mamindra fampifandraisana na oviana na oviana izy io, ary tsy mamorona rakitra RRD na mikitika ny lahatahirin-drakitry ny SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Hamarino ny Rakitra"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Fanamarinana Fanafarana"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Tsy nisy zavatra voasoratra."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Hiverina"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Tsy azo ampidirina ny rakitra raha tsy voavaha ireo hadisoana ireo. Tsy nisy zavatra voasoratra."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Efa mifanaraka amin'ny rakitra ny fametrahana. Tsy misy zavatra hafarana."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Drafitra %s. Ny fampiharana dia manao ireo fanovana ireo indray mandeha ao anatin'ny dingana iray. Raha niova ny rakitra na ny fametrahana taorian'ity fanamarinana ity, dia lavina ny fanafarana ary manamarina indray ianao."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Ampiharo ny Fanafarana"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Foano"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Hanampy Lasibatra SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "tsy misy lasibatra SmokePing mifanaraka"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Tsindrio ny Tohizo mba hanampiana ny lasibatra SmokePing izay manana mpampiantrano mitovy amin'ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano amin'ny fitaovana tsirairay voafantina. Ny lasibatra tsirairay dia mahazo kisary famintinana ho an'ny fampitandremana ary, rehefa azo atao kisary ny angon-drakitry ny SmokePing, kisary smoke. Tsy misy fitaovana foronina eto."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Lasibatra %d no mifanaraka."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Zavatra %d noforonina na nampifandraisina, %d nodinganina."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Manana lasibatra SmokePing ity fitaovana ity, saingy ny mpamaky izay mameno ny sandan'ny famintinana dia mandeha eo amin'ny poller %d ary ny fitaovana dia voatahiry eo amin'ny poller %d. Mijanona ny sandan'ny famintinana sy ny fampitandremana mandra-panendry indray ny fitaovana ho eo amin'ny poller %d."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Lasibatra SmokePing an'ity Fitaovana ity"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Kisary smoke %d no mbola mandoko ny loko hafa; mamindra hatramin'ny 200 isaky ny tsingerina ny poller fototra."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Kisary smoke %d no tsy azo nafindra; alefaso ny upgrade-graphs mba hanandrana azy ireo indray, ary jereo ny firaketana Cacti hahitana ny antony."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Ny fikirakirana Loss Colors dia mangataka loko fahaverezana SmokePing %s, saingy SmokePing %s no hitan'ny mpamaky. Ataovy Ho azy (Automatic) izany raha tsy hoe tokony ho samy hafa amin'ny an'ny SmokePing ny kisary."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Ny fikirakirana Loss Colors dia misafidy ny loko fahaverezana SmokePing %s ho an'ny kisary smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Tsy nahita kinova SmokePing ny mpamaky, ka ny fikirakirana Loss Colors dia misafidy ny loko fahaverezana ho an'ny SmokePing 2.8 sy ny aoriana. Raha SmokePing 2.7 ny anao, dia ataovy SmokePing 2.7 ny Loss Colors."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Nahita SmokePing %s ny mpamaky, ka misafidy ny loko fahaverezana avy amin'izany ny fikirakirana Loss Colors."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Tsy voapetraka ny Thold, ka tsy misy lasibatra mampitandrina ao amin'ny SmokePing sy ny Thold miaraka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Tsy misy lasibatra manana fampitandremana SmokePing sy fetra Thold miasa miaraka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Lasibatra %d no manana fampitandremana SmokePing sy fetra Thold miasa miaraka, ka mety hampandre indroa ny olana iray. Ampitahao ny fepetra fampitandremana alohan'ny hanesorana ny iray: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fanafarana ny lasitra SmokePing ary tsy averina andramana ho azy: %s Ampiasao ny Andramo Indray ny Fanafarana Lasitra rehefa voavaha ny antony."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Tsy mbola nafarana ny lasitra SmokePing. Ampiasao ny Andramo Indray ny Fanafarana Lasitra."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Voafatra ny lasitra SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Ny fitaovana tsirairay manana loharanon-drakitra famintinana dia angonin'ny poller-n'ny mpamaky."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Fitaovana %d no manana loharanon-drakitra famintinana nefa tsy angonin'ny poller %d, izay mampandeha ny mpamaky, ka tsy manana angon-drakitra ny sandan'ny famintinana sy ny fampitandremana azy ireo: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Eo amin'ny poller %d no vakiana ny fikirakirana SmokePing, fa tsy eo amin'ity mpizara ity; ny laharan'ny lisitra dia mampiseho ny vokatry ny famakiana farany nataony."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Tsy azo vakiana ny fikirakirana SmokePing %s: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Ny fikirakirana SmokePing %s dia mitanisa lasibatra %d; fidirana %d no nodinganina: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Ny fikirakirana SmokePing %s dia mitanisa lasibatra %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Foana ny fikirakirana ny lalan'ny rakitra PHP na tsy rakitra azo alefa izy io, ka tsy afaka manomboka ny mpamaky."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Manomboka amin'ny %s ny mpamaky."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Tsy mbola nahavita fihodinana iray ny mpamaky teo amin'ity poller ity."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Ny fihodinan'ny mpamaky farany dia nifarana %d segondra lasa izay, mihoatra ny elanelam-potoana telon'ny poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Namaky andiany %d amin'ny %d tao anatin'ny %.1f segondra ny mpamaky ary nihoatra ny teti-potoanany in-%d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Namaky andiany %d amin'ny %d tao anatin'ny %.1f segondra ny mpamaky, %d segondra lasa izay."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Tsy mbola nisy lisitra novakiana teo amin'ity poller ity."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny lisitra farany %d segondra lasa izay ary mbola ampiasaina ny teo aloha: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Nitanisa lasibatra %d ny lisitra %d segondra lasa izay."

