msgid "Import SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Manafatra Fikirakirana SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Fikirakirana"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Ny rakitra SmokePing voakirakira dia vakiana miaraka amin'ny rakitra ampidiriny, avy ao amin'ny lahatahiriny manokana. Ny rakitra nampakarina dia vakiana samirery: tsy mahazo mampiasa @include ao anatiny."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Ny rakitra voakirakira, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "Rakitra nampakarina, tsy misy @include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Rakitra Nampakarina"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Ho an'ny rakitra nampakarina ihany: fikirakirana SmokePing tsy mihoatra ny 4 MiB."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Fitaovana"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Ny fitaovana iray isaky ny mpampiantrano SmokePing dia manambatra ny lasibatra mandinika ny mpampiantrano iray ihany. Ny fitaovana efa manana ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano eo amin'ny poller voafidy no ampiasaina fa tsy mamorona vaovao."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Fitaovana iray isaky ny mpampiantrano SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Fitaovana iray isaky ny lasibatra SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Lasitra Fitaovana"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Ny lasitry ny fitaovana foronin'ny fanafarana."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "Ny poller-n'ny fitaovana vaovao. Tsy maintsy ilay poller mampandeha ny mpamaky SmokePing izany, raha tsy izany dia tsy hahazo angon-drakitra ny loharanon-drakitra famintinana azy ireo."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Toerana"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The site of new devices."
msgstr "Ny toerana misy ny fitaovana vaovao."

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tsy misy"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Hazon-kisary"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Tarataro ao amin'ny hazon-kisary ny ambaratongan'ny SmokePing: ny fizarana tsirairay dia lasa sampana, ary ny fitaovana tsirairay dia mpampiantrano eo ambanin'ny sampan'ny lasibatra azy. Ampiasaina indray ny sampana sy mpampiantrano efa misy."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Hazo vaovao, voalaza eto ambany ny anarany"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Aza taratarina"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny Hazo Vaovao"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Ho an'ny hazo vaovao ihany. Ny hazo efa manana io anarana io no ampiasaina."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Ny topi-maso dia mamaky ny fikirakirana ary mitanisa izay ho foronin'ny fanafarana. Tsy misy soratana raha tsy manamafy io lisitra io eo amin'ny efijery manaraka ianao, ary tsy misy fanoratana atao amin'ny rakitra manokan'ny SmokePing na oviana na oviana."

