#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Ny poller Cacti izay mandeha eo amin'ny mpampiantrano SmokePing, na mizara rafitra rakitra aminy. Io poller io ihany no mamaky ny angona SmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Rakitra fikirakirana SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Ny rakitra fikirakirana fototra SmokePing, vakian'ny poller izay mampandeha ny mpamaky. Mamaky azy io sy ireo rakitra ampidiriny amin'ny alalan'ny mpandinika azy manokana ny plugin ary tsy manoratra ao amin'izy ireo mihitsy. Ny rakitra ampidirina dia tsy maintsy mijanona ao anatin'ny lahatahirin'ity rakitra ity."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Lahatahiry angona SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Ny datadir avy amin'ny fikirakirana SmokePing, araka ny fahitan'ny SmokePing azy."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Fampifandraisana Cacti amin'ny lahatahiry angona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Fampifandraisana bind na NFS azo vakiana ihany ho an'ny lahatahiry angona SmokePing ao anatin'ny lalan'ny RRA an'ny Cacti. Ny Cacti dia tsy mamaky afa-tsy ireo rakitra RRD ao anatin'ny lalan'ny RRA-ny ary tsy mamaky amin'ny alalan'ny rohy an'ohatra (symlink) mihitsy."

